{"id":"5c268cc9a199d00a","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-derivability-conditions.md","title":"Selected Predicate Satisfies P1–P3","display":"lem-derivability-conditions — Selected Predicate Satisfies P1–P3","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-derivability-conditions","aliases":["92-lem-derivability-conditions"],"display":"lem-derivability-conditions — Selected Predicate Satisfies P1–P3","source":"第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 123–124）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-derivability-conditions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-derivability-conditions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-derivability-conditions — Selected Predicate Satisfies P1–P3"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 123–124）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"466c532d80d46a83\" href=\"?note=466c532d80d46a83\" title=\"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate\">92-df-hbl-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,B_G,\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(G,B_G,\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> 如<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_G(B_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_G(B_G)\\)</span> 是所选参数的条件；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})=\\Box_{B_G}X\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})=\\Box_{B_G}X\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 为句子集、数码和本地编号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}derivability\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{HBL}_G(B_G)\\Longrightarrow\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\vdash X\\Longrightarrow\nG\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\to Y\\urcorner})\n\\to(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner Y\\urcorner}))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}derivability\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{HBL}_G(B_G)\\Longrightarrow\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\vdash X\\Longrightarrow\nG\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\to Y\\urcorner})\n\\to(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner Y\\urcorner}))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本引理是把 HBL 定义实例化到选定的公式构造器，三个条件不再被当作仅有语义表示正确性的一般定理。P1 还可由正数码实例验证与存在引入独立得到；P2 需要内化 MP 的证明组合；P3 的标准算术证明使用形式化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性，原书明确引用而不详证。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 123–124）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"466c532d80d46a83","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,B_G,\\mathrm{Prov}_G$ 如[[92-df-provability-predicate]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,B_G,\\mathrm{Prov}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HBL}_G(B_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})=\\Box_{B_G}X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}derivability\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{HBL}_G(B_G)\\Longrightarrow\\Bigl[&\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\vdash X\\Longrightarrow\nG\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner}))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\to Y\\urcorner})\n\\to(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner Y\\urcorner}))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":2045,"backlinks":[{"id":"f29382efb1ab3219","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"603b78700e219950","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on